57
00:03:46,530 --> 00:03:48,660
Context is the new code for AI these days.

58
00:03:50,260 --> 00:03:51,770
Stop prompt engineering.

59
00:03:51,780 --> 00:03:57,120
I think we have moved away from the
world of prompt engineering and come to

60
00:03:57,120 --> 00:04:02,180
a world where it's more about building
the right knowledge base and context

61
00:04:02,180 --> 00:04:04,170
engineering that knowledge page base.

