64
00:04:12,110 --> 00:04:15,260
So the idea is create a living
knowledge graph from whatever

65
00:04:15,260 --> 00:04:17,710
scatt-scattered data and tools you have.

66
00:04:18,360 --> 00:04:22,370
Ground AI decisions in truth,
