67
00:04:22,370 --> 00:04:26,080
So it's-- you should not
always say the model is bad.

68
00:04:26,520 --> 00:04:29,210
The models are actually
doing amazingly good.

69
00:04:29,310 --> 00:04:33,200
It's more how you engineer the context
so that your AI does not hallucinate

