How do you catch failures when
you're making changes in the code,

74
00:04:46,928 --> 00:04:50,838
in your AI code, how do you catch
failures soon enough so that your

75
00:04:50,868 --> 00:04:52,528
users are not impacted by it?

76
00:04:53,188 --> 00:04:54,808
And how do you create a feedback loop?

77
00:04:54,808 --> 00:04:57,578
If folks are getting impacted
by it, how do you know?

78
00:04:58,068 --> 00:05:00,668
And once how do you keep--
create a feedback loop so

79
00:05:00,668 --> 00:05:01,988
