97
00:06:03,027 --> 00:06:07,827
that, "Are you sending the sensitive
data to LLMs? How are you tackling it?

98
00:06:08,248 --> 00:06:13,308
How are you making sure that it is not
taking rogue actions, bringing down

99
00:06:13,308 --> 00:06:16,998
your production database?" We have all
